        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7502/35, 1-3/8 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Round Sliding Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Round Brushed Stainless Steel Flush Pull has a 1-3/8 inch diameter. The 1-3/8 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Round Sliding Door Pull is usually used on sliding pocket doors or other lightweight sliding doors or drawers. A low profile design allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. It features a lip for fingers to catch on to for easy use and is pressure mounted (no screws or nails). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/2-9-16-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-flush-pull-omnia-7500-65\"><b>2-9/16 Inch Round Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/2-inch-round-brushed-stainless-steel-flush-pull-omnia-7501-51\"><b>2 Inch Round Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 7502/35 Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Diameter: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Hole Cut Out: 1-1/64\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
